          "path": "_m/w/y/d/m/deoksugung-wp/deoksugung-palace-3.jpg",
          "filename": "Deoksugung Palace 3.jpg",
          "caption": "Deoksu or Deoksugung Palace, also known as Gyeongun-gung, Deoksugung is a compound of walled palaces that was inhabited by the royal family of the Chosun Dynasty  until colonial period. It is one of the \"Five Grand Palaces\" built by the kings of the Joseon Dynasty. Along with the buildings of the Place the place include also gardens, a statue of King Sejong and the National Museum of Art. It is located in the heart of Seoul near to the city hall.#WLM2017 #WLMKorea",
